This repository contains code only. It does not redistribute imagery or data. Users who run the
pipeline obtain data from its providers under their own terms:
- USGS EROS declassified satellite imagery (Declass 1/2/3) via EarthExplorer / M2M API.
- Copernicus Sentinel-1/2 and Copernicus DEM (contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data and
  Copernicus DEM data), accessed through Google Earth Engine.
- JAXA ALOS PALSAR yearly mosaics (JAXA attribution required).
Reference coordinates in config/ are taken from IAEA (2005), STI/PUB/1215 (public).
